Output-dependent cubic simulation
Copyright 2026 Daniel Fredriksen / Quantyra Inc.

The code is authored within the Quantyra research workstream with AI
assistance. The export preserves its originating paths and commits in
PROVENANCE.json. No external implementation was copied for this export.

The method uses established mathematical ingredients from the works
cited in manuscript/references.bib, particularly the equatorial norm
estimator of Bravyi et al. (2019), covering sets of Maslov et al. (2024),
and independent spaces discussed by Blaser et al. (2026).

